1irv|n|Formerly, an entertainment at which each person contributed some dish to a common table; now, an excursion or pleasure party in which the members partake of a collation or repast (usually in the open air, and from food carried by themselves). ; To go on a picnic, or pleasure excursion; to eat in public fashion.	N:20gx,56,3~20gx,56,3
